From 32f012f1053a7def066fbc3b52c07bb8bf8a6b82 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: x4pro-emu <kf1178@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 6 Sep 2026 15:26:38 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 04/15] xteink-x4pro: I2C0 + GT911/PCF8563/CW2017, LEDC,
 deep-sleep overlay, touch/battery QOM

- hw/i2c/esp32s3_i2c.c: S3 I2C master (FIFO mode, COMD list) on an I2CBus, trace-i2c.
- hw/misc/x4pro_i2c_devs.c: GT911 (INT line, power gating via GPIO2), BM8563/PCF8563,
  CW2017 with the OEM BATINFO resident.
- hw/misc/esp32s3_ledc.c: LS channels/timers, duty observable per channel.
- hw/misc/x4pro_sleep.c: RTC_CNTL sleep registers; deep sleep pauses the VM, a wake
  source resets with cause DSLEEP and EXT1 status.
- xteink_x4pro.c: input.touch/home, board.battery-soc/mv, state JSON extended.
